---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import {SITE_TITLE} from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
              description="About Alexander Lee’s personal website and blog at alexanderlee.tech."/>
</head>
<body>
<Header/>
<main>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>My name is Alexander Lee. I'm a software technologist based in New Zealand.</p>
    <p>Currently I work at Canva as a software engineer in the frontend sub-specialty. Previously I've worked at
        Xero.</p>
    <p>Some of my personal projects have included <a href="https://kiwisync.com">KiwiSync</a>, a bank sync service for
        YNAB in New Zealand; a now defunct Discord bot called <a href="https://https://github.com/alexsurelee/VicBot">VicBot</a>,
        which was developed over my undergraduate career to maintain an engineering-wide server; and a secret third thing that I'm working on in the background.</p>
</main>
<Footer/>
</body>
</html>
